## Submitting your work

ALWAYS use {{ .ResultToolName }} when sending a message to the user. Never emit a plain response.

Use `kind="message"` for normal updates, `kind="ask"` when you need user input, and `kind="final"` when the work is complete.

For automation workflows, include structured output on `kind="final"` calls: `{message, data, artifacts}`.

Every response includes an inbox with pending user messages. Read and act on them.
